{
  "source": "Prompts/why-answers-vary-v15.mp4",
  "duration": 184.9813125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.86,
      "text": "You ask AI, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.46,
      "end": 4.64,
      "text": "It suggests Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.34,
      "end": 8.12,
      "text": "You start a new chat and ask the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.64,
      "end": 10.32,
      "text": "This time, it suggests Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.2,
      "end": 13.68,
      "text": "Why did the same question get a different answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.42,
      "end": 16.98,
      "text": "Three main components dictate an AI's response."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.68,
      "end": 19.7,
      "text": "First, the specific model you use"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.7,
      "end": 20.8,
      "text": "and its processing time."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.38,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "Second, what the AI receives,"
    },
    {
      "start": 23.52,
      "end": 25.18,
      "text": "your prompt and provided context."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.82,
      "end": 28.54,
      "text": "But the third column is where the real mechanics live."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.03,
      "end": 31.66,
      "text": "AI uses techniques giving different tokens a chance,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.3,
      "end": 33.46,
      "text": "sampling and temperature."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.3,
      "end": 35.94,
      "text": "Take a look at this probabilities chart."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.54,
      "end": 39.48,
      "text": "The AI has generated the phrase, you could name him"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 41.28,
      "text": "and is evaluating its options"
    },
    {
      "start": 41.28,
      "end": 43.02,
      "text": "for the next open blank choice."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.7,
      "end": 47.36,
      "text": "At this exact blank, the AI calculates a probability"
    },
    {
      "start": 47.36,
      "end": 49.4,
      "text": "for every token in its vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.02,
      "end": 53.74,
      "text": "Right now, Spot leads the starting odds at 22%."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.11,
      "end": 56.56,
      "text": "You might expect the AI to pick the winner automatically,"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.36,
      "end": 60.9,
      "text": "but a 22% probability means AI would pick Spot"
    },
    {
      "start": 60.9,
      "end": 63.32,
      "text": "about 22 times out of 100 dries."
    },
    {
      "start": 63.68,
      "end": 65.64,
      "text": "On average, if the odds stay the same,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.94,
      "end": 66.92,
      "text": "that's called sampling."
    },
    {
      "start": 67.7,
      "end": 69.7,
      "text": "If we run five separate random picks"
    },
    {
      "start": 69.7,
      "end": 72.24,
      "text": "with these exact unchanged probabilities,"
    },
    {
      "start": 72.62,
      "end": 74.0,
      "text": "we get a specific sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.76,
      "end": 75.8,
      "text": "Pick one, Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 76.5,
      "end": 77.74,
      "text": "Pick two, Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 78.38,
      "end": 79.66,
      "text": "Pick three, Buddy."
    },
    {
      "start": 80.3,
      "end": 81.64,
      "text": "Pick four, Rex."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.38,
      "end": 83.82,
      "text": "And pick five, Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.56,
      "end": 87.74,
      "text": "Spot was picked only once, even with the highest probability."
    },
    {
      "start": 88.46,
      "end": 90.94,
      "text": "Another five picks could turn out entirely differently."
    },
    {
      "start": 91.56,
      "end": 92.86,
      "text": "Why does AI work this way?"
    },
    {
      "start": 93.76,
      "end": 96.86,
      "text": "Choosing the absolute most likely token every single time"
    },
    {
      "start": 96.86,
      "end": 98.56,
      "text": "makes the AI's answers rigid,"
    },
    {
      "start": 98.96,
      "end": 100.5,
      "text": "predictable and highly repetitive."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.28,
      "end": 103.68,
      "text": "Giving other likely tokens a chance to be selected"
    },
    {
      "start": 103.68,
      "end": 105.34,
      "text": "introduces essential variety."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.22,
      "end": 108.84,
      "text": "It makes the generated text feel more creative"
    },
    {
      "start": 108.84,
      "end": 110.42,
      "text": "and natural to a human reader."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.42,
      "end": 113.7,
      "text": "Choosing a different token shapes what comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.3,
      "end": 117.2,
      "text": "One slightly different token choice at a critical juncture"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.2,
      "end": 120.5,
      "text": "can send the entire remainder of the generated answer"
    },
    {
      "start": 120.5,
      "end": 122.08,
      "text": "in a completely new direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.54,
      "end": 124.46,
      "text": "Sampling selects a token using probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 125.82,
      "end": 127.16,
      "text": "Temperature adjusts those probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 128.04,
      "end": 130.28,
      "text": "In chat GPT, Gemini, and Claude,"
    },
    {
      "start": 130.88,
      "end": 132.66,
      "text": "temperature is set for you behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "start": 133.02,
      "end": 135.24,
      "text": "This chart compares how different temperature settings"
    },
    {
      "start": 135.24,
      "end": 137.14,
      "text": "change the odds for each dog name."
    },
    {
      "start": 138.14,
      "end": 139.32,
      "text": "Notice the center column."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.76,
      "end": 141.94,
      "text": "These are the starting odds derived directly"
    },
    {
      "start": 141.94,
      "end": 144.36,
      "text": "from the model's training and the context you provided."
    },
    {
      "start": 145.04,
      "end": 147.32,
      "text": "A low temperature setting concentrates the odds"
    },
    {
      "start": 147.32,
      "end": 148.74,
      "text": "onto the most likely choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.8,
      "end": 152.76,
      "text": "Spot leads at 22%, but at low temperature,"
    },
    {
      "start": 152.98,
      "end": 155.12,
      "text": "its chance jumps to 36%."
    },
    {
      "start": 155.12,
      "end": 157.34,
      "text": "A high temperature setting does the opposite"
    },
    {
      "start": 157.64,
      "end": 159.66,
      "text": "by spreading the odds out more widely."
    },
    {
      "start": 160.26,
      "end": 163.24,
      "text": "Here, Spot's chance falls to 16%."
    },
    {
      "start": 163.8,
      "end": 166.7,
      "text": "Both settings manipulate the exact same starting odds."
    },
    {
      "start": 166.7,
      "end": 169.72,
      "text": "The other category comprises the vast remainder"
    },
    {
      "start": 169.72,
      "end": 170.58,
      "text": "of the vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 171.18,
      "end": 173.22,
      "text": "Spot remains the most likely individual token"
    },
    {
      "start": 173.22,
      "end": 174.36,
      "text": "at all three settings."
    },
    {
      "start": 175.42,
      "end": 176.74,
      "text": "Temperature changes its probability."
    },
    {
      "start": 178.02,
      "end": 179.04,
      "text": "AI answers vary."
    },
    {
      "start": 179.68,
      "end": 182.44,
      "text": "Different inputs, different odds, different choices."
    }
  ],
